<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Contact Us — Brüder Kompressor (Prototype)</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --yellow: #ffcd03;
    --black: #000000;
    --cream: #ede8df;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    /* font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; */
    color: var(--black);
    line-height: 1.5;
    /* background: var(--cream); */
  }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 70px;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    /* background: var(--yellow); */
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  /* Intro heading */
  .intro {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    margin: 2rem auto 0;
  }

  .intro h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #444;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* Two-column base */
  .two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  /* Contact info list */
  .info-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .info-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .info-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .info-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #777;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    margin: 0 0 0.15rem;
  }

  .info-value {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .info-value a {
    color: var(--black);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .info-value a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Form */
  .form-field {
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }

  .form-field label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .form-field input,
  .form-field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid #d1d1d1;
    border-radius: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .form-field textarea {
    min-height: 110px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .form-field input:focus,
  .form-field textarea:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--black);
    outline-offset: 1px;
  }

  .submit-btn {
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--black);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .submit-btn:hover {
    background: #e6b900;
  }

  /* Support lists (what happens next / when to contact) */
  .support-list h3 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .support-list ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .support-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #333;
  }

  /* Trust banner */
  .trust-banner {
    background: var(--black);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .trust-banner .main-line {
    color: var(--yellow);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .trust-banner .sub-line {
    color: var(--cream);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Dealer CTA */
  .dealer-cta {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .dealer-cta h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .dealer-cta p {
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    color: #444;
  }

  .dealer-cta a.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--black);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 0;
  }

  .dealer-cta a.btn:hover {
    background: #e6b900;
  }

  /* Placeholder sections (news + testimonials, to be designed later) */
  .placeholder {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px dashed #ccc;
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: #999;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .page-footer-space {
    height: 3rem;
  }

  /* Mobile responsive */
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .wrap {
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
    }

    .two-col {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .intro {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .intro h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .trust-banner {
      padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .trust-banner .main-line {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .dealer-cta {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  {% comment %} <section class="hero">
    <h1>Contact us</h1>
  </section> {% endcomment %}

  <main class="wrap">

    <section class="intro">
        <h1 style="text-align: center;">Contact us</h1>
        <h2>Speak to the right people</h2>
        <p>Whether you're chasing pricing, technical advice, dealer support, or parts — we'll point you in the right direction quickly.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="two-col">
      <div class="card">
        <ul class="info-list">
          <li>
            <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p class="info-label">Phone</p>
              <p class="info-value"><a href="tel:1300088990">1300 088 990</a></p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-10 6L2 7"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p class="info-label">Email</p>
              <p class="info-value"><a href="mailto:info@bruderaustralia.com.au">info@bruderaustralia.com.au</a></p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12S4 16 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p class="info-label">Head office</p>
              <p class="info-value">32 Secker Road, Mount Barker, South Australia 5251</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p class="info-label">Operating hours</p>
              <p class="info-value">Monday to Friday, 7:00AM to 5:00PM (not including public holidays)</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M9 15h6M9 11h6M9 19h4"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p class="info-label">ABN</p>
              <p class="info-value">17 662 786 441</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Prototype only — form does not submit.');">
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Name" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="company">Company (optional)</label>
            <input type="text" id="company" name="company" placeholder="Company">
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="postcode">Postcode (optional)</label>
            <input type="text" id="postcode" name="postcode" placeholder="Postcode">
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="phone">Phone number</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="Your phone number">
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Message" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Submit</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="two-col">
      <div class="card support-list">
        <h3>What happens next?</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>We review your enquiry within business hours</li>
          <li>The right person responds — not a call centre</li>
          <li>If needed, we'll connect you with your nearest dealer</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card support-list">
        <h3>When to contact us directly</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>You're comparing compressor options</li>
          <li>You need help specifying equipment</li>
          <li>You're a hire company or mining operation</li>
          <li>You want to discuss custom requirements</li>
          <li>You're looking to become a dealer</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="trust-banner">
      <p class="main-line">We are Trusted by Farmers, Hire Companies and Mining Operations across Australia.</p>
      <p class="sub-line">We build equipment for people who depend on it. The same applies to our support.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="dealer-cta">
      <h3>Looking for a local dealer?</h3>
      <p>Find your nearest authorised Brüder dealer here.</p>
      <a href="/pages/dealer-locations" class="btn">Find a dealer</a>
    </section>

    {% comment %} <section class="placeholder">
      In News and Insights — design pending
    </section> {% endcomment %}

    {% comment %} <section class="placeholder">
      From the Field (testimonials) — design pending
    </section> {% endcomment %}

    <div class="page-footer-space"></div>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
